# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://rangka-os.github.io/rangka-os/schema/0.5/module.json
name: kitchen
version: 1.0.0
title: {id: Tiket dapur, en: Kitchen tickets}
# Kitchen tickets of an F&B outlet that sells through the cashier (module pos). The owner names the stations of each
# outlet (Bar, Dapur panas) and sends each item category to a station; an outlet without stations makes no ticket, so a
# shop on the same cashier is untouched. When a receipt is paid (pos_sale submitted) flow kitchen_ticket_on_sale makes
# one ticket per station with the lines whose item category goes there; items of an unrouted category (bottled water)
# make no ticket. Kitchen staff move a ticket new -> cooking -> ready, the waiter or cashier marks it picked up; each
# step is stamped with its time by flow kitchen_ticket_on_update (one step back, the work screen's "Urungkan", clears
# the stamp). A voided receipt voids its tickets; a corrected receipt (amend) makes new tickets marked as a revision.
# The kitchen screen (screens/dapur.rk) is a queue screen of kernel contract 0030 over these tickets.
requires: {rangka: '>=0.5', users: ^1.2, catalogue: ^1.3, outlets: ^1.2, pos: ^1.0}
